     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Hi everyone,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">I am working with the red kite. Two visits were made. To carry out the analysis, I have been guided by the online course (Chapter 7, CDS), when I want to make the models I get the following message:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:large\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:blue\">model1 &lt;- ds(mreal, key=&quot;hn&quot;, adjustment=NULL, convert_units = conversion)</span><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:large\"><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in checkdata(data, region_table, sample_table, obs_table, formula) : \r\n  A sample has a non-unique &quot;Effort&quot;, check data!</span></span></pre></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">To estimate density and abundance by location and season (winter 2022 and 2023), is post-stratification appropriate?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Any help is greatly appreciated!!</span><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Best.</span></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">PS. </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Attached to database</span></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">--------------------------------------------</span></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\"><strong>Alan Omar Bermúdez Cavero</strong></span></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><font color=\"#808080\" face=\"Arial\">RENACYT: P0011859</font></div></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial\"></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105)\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:+51%20943%20825%20461\" value=\"+51943825461\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(+51) 943825461</a><br></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
